        "created_at": "2014-04-29T03:47:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since GTG has been all about PAX over the last couple of years, do you guys have any thoughts about making the inagural PAX South in San Antonio? &nbsp;I'd love to volunteer/demo for GTG at a con but you haven't made it this far south. &nbsp;Plus it would hopefully be right after Tactics comes out. &nbsp;Just curious if it's in the plan for early next years</p>",
